OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage shame list reveals
OL,4,AScottish firms that failed to pay staff
OL,5,
OL,6,FFifty firms in Scotland have been
OL,7,Frevealed on a UK government list naming
OL,8,Fand shaming employers that failed to
OL,9,Fpay staff minimum wage.
OL,11,FThree of the companies topping the list
OL,12,Fin Scotland - including North East
OL,13,Fbakers Murdoch Allan & Son - each owed
OL,14,Fmore than #20,000 to underpaid workers.
OL,16,FThe Department for Business said 658
OL,17,Femployers across the UK have been
OL,18,Fordered to repay #4m after more than
OL,19,F27,000 workers have been left out of
OL,20,Fpocket.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
